usage: tune.py [-h] [--project-dir PROJECT_DIR] [--data-dir DATA_DIR]
               [--model-dir MODEL_DIR] [--output-dir OUTPUT_DIR]
               [--training-dir TRAINING_DIR] [--weather WEATHER]
               [--threads THREADS] [--targets {industry,resident}]
               {train,predict,run,tune,serve,convert} ...

日用电量18天预测

positional arguments:
  {train,predict,run,tune,serve,convert}
    train               完整训练，输出到独立模型运行目录
    predict             从CSV预测并保存到独立输出目录
    run                 先训练，再使用本次模型预测
    tune                Optuna搜索、严格时间回测及独立测试对比
    serve               启动HTTP服务
    convert             显式转换原始JSON，写入独立导入目录

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --project-dir PROJECT_DIR
  --data-dir DATA_DIR
  --model-dir MODEL_DIR
  --output-dir OUTPUT_DIR
  --training-dir TRAINING_DIR
  --weather WEATHER
  --threads THREADS     LightGBM执行线程数；未传则沿用库默认行为
  --targets {industry,resident}
                        可重复指定；默认两个目标
